*This post was originally hosted on my old Blogspot blog. The approximate
publication date and title are known but its contents are lost to time. This
stub remains for posterity.*

*LibMinecraft was a .NET library for writing Minecraft servers and clients.
You can see what remains of it [archived here](https://web.archive.org/web/20120223233615/https://libminecraft.codeplex.com/).
PartyCraft was a Minecraft server based on LibMinecraft. It's archived
[here](https://github.com/ddevault/partycraft).*
